# Type-check the whole library + test suite for the C++ target WITHOUT emitting
# any output (no C++ compiler required). Useful for fast CI / DCE-shape checks.
#
#   haxe tests_check.hxml
#
-debug
-lib utest
-lib hxcpp
-cp src
-cp tests
-main hxSockets.tests.HaxeSocketTests
-cpp tests/cpp
--no-output
